{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0003", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He coughed all night.", "chosen": "Он кашлял всю ночь.", "rejected": "Он кашлял вся ночь.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - вся is nominative; the accusative всю is required after the verb for the duration expression]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0004", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The nurse took my blood pressure.", "chosen": "Медсестра измерила мне давление.", "rejected": "Медсестра взяла моё давление крови.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - взяла давление крови is a calque; измерить давление is the standard Russian medical phrasing]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0005", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I'm running a temperature.", "chosen": "У меня температура.", "rejected": "Я бегу температуру.", "defect_type": "missing_idiom", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: missing_idiom - бегу температуру does not exist in Russian; running a temperature maps to у меня температура]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0006", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He has been having trouble sleeping.", "chosen": "У него проблемы со сном.", "rejected": "Он имеет трудности со спанием.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - он имеет is a calque and спание is not standard; у него проблемы со сном is the natural construction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0007", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "Take this medication with food.", "chosen": "Принимайте это лекарство во время еды.", "rejected": "Возьмите это лекарство с едой.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - взять means to take physically not to take medication; принимать is correct and с едой needs во время еды]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0008", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She twisted her wrist.", "chosen": "Она вывихнула запястье.", "rejected": "Она скрутила своё запястье.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - скрутить means to wring not to sprain; вывихнуть or подвернуть are correct for a joint injury]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0009", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I have a stiff neck.", "chosen": "У меня болит шея.", "rejected": "У меня жёсткая шея.", "defect_type": "missing_idiom", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: missing_idiom - жёсткая шея is a literal translation; stiff neck as pain maps to у меня болит шея or шея затекла]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0010", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The headache won't go away.", "chosen": "Головная боль не проходит.", "rejected": "Головная боль не уйдёт.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - уйти means to leave physically; проходить is the correct verb for pain or symptoms subsiding]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0011", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She went to see a specialist.", "chosen": "Она пошла к специалисту.", "rejected": "Она пошла видеть специалиста.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - пошла видеть is a calque of went to see; Russian uses directional пошла к without видеть]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0012", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I'm out of breath.", "chosen": "Я запыхался.", "rejected": "Я вне дыхания.", "defect_type": "missing_idiom", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: missing_idiom - вне дыхания is a literal calque; out of breath maps to запыхаться or задыхаться]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0013", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "His condition has improved.", "chosen": "Его состояние улучшилось.", "rejected": "Его кондиция улучшилась.", "defect_type": "false_friend", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: false_friend - кондиция means physical fitness not medical condition; состояние is correct]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0014", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I need a prescription for this medicine.", "chosen": "Мне нужен рецепт на это лекарство.", "rejected": "Мне нужна прескрипция для этого медикамента.", "defect_type": "false_friend", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: false_friend - прескрипция is not a Russian word; рецепт is the correct term for a medical prescription]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0015", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She recovered quickly.", "chosen": "Она быстро поправилась.", "rejected": "Она быстро выздоровела.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - выздороветь is slightly more formal and clinical; поправиться is the natural everyday verb for getting better]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
