{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0017", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I can't sleep because of the pain.", "chosen": "Я не могу спать из-за боли.", "rejected": "Я не сплю потому что имею боль.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - имею боль is a calque; из-за боли with the infinitive is the natural construction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0018", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The swelling went down after the ice pack.", "chosen": "Отёк спал после ледяного компресса.", "rejected": "Опухоль пошла вниз после льда.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - пошла вниз is a directional calque; спасть is the correct verb for swelling reducing]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
