{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0024", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She fainted in the heat.", "chosen": "Она упала в обморок от жары.", "rejected": "Она упала в беспамятство от тепла.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - тепло means warmth not intense heat; жара is correct; обморок is the standard word for fainting not беспамятство]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0025", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "You need more rest.", "chosen": "Вам нужно больше отдыхать.", "rejected": "Вам нужно больше покоя.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - покой implies peace and stillness not active rest; отдыхать is the natural recommendation for getting more rest]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0026", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I have a slight cough.", "chosen": "У меня небольшой кашель.", "rejected": "У меня слегка кашляю.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - слегка кашляю mixes adverb with verb making an ungrammatical predicate; noun construction у меня небольшой кашель is correct]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0027", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He is in good health.", "chosen": "Он в хорошей форме.", "rejected": "Он имеет хорошее здоровье.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - он имеет хорошее здоровье is a calque; он в хорошей форме or у него хорошее здоровье is natural]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0028", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The test came back negative.", "chosen": "Анализ показал отрицательный результат.", "rejected": "Тест пришёл назад отрицательным.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - пришёл назад is a calque of came back; анализ показал отрицательный результат is the standard phrasing]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0029", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I have trouble breathing.", "chosen": "Мне тяжело дышать.", "rejected": "Я имею трудности с дыханием.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - я имею трудности is a calque; мне тяжело дышать is the natural dative impersonal construction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0030", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She is on a strict diet.", "chosen": "Она соблюдает строгую диету.", "rejected": "Она находится на строгой диете.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - находится на диете is grammatically acceptable but соблюдать диету is more natural for following a diet]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0031", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The injection didn't hurt at all.", "chosen": "Укол совсем не болел.", "rejected": "Инъекция совсем не больно.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - больно is an adverb and cannot be predicate for иньекция; болел agrees with укол as the subject]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0032", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He needs to quit smoking.", "chosen": "Ему нужно бросить курить.", "rejected": "Ему нужно оставить курение.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - оставить курение is unusual; бросить курить is the standard collocation for quitting smoking]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0033", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "I feel much better today.", "chosen": "Сегодня мне значительно лучше.", "rejected": "Сегодня я чувствую себя более лучше.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - более лучше is a double comparative which is ungrammatical; значительно лучше is correct]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0034", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "She had her wisdom teeth removed.", "chosen": "Ей удалили зубы мудрости.", "rejected": "Ей вырвали мудрые зубы.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - мудрые зубы is a calque; зубы мудрости is the standard Russian term for wisdom teeth]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0035", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "The doctor told him to avoid stress.", "chosen": "Врач велел ему избегать стресса.", "rejected": "Врач сказал ему избегать стресс.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - стресс in genitive стресса is required after избегать which governs genitive case]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0036", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "I have been coughing, sneezing, and feeling feverish since Monday.", "chosen": "Я кашляю, чихаю и чувствую жар с понедельника.", "rejected": "Я кашляю с понедельника.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - sneezing and feverish are omitted reducing a multi-symptom account to a single symptom]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0037", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "She takes insulin twice a day and monitors her blood sugar every morning.", "chosen": "Она принимает инсулин два раза в день и контролирует сахар в крови каждое утро.", "rejected": "Она принимает инсулин каждый день.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - twice a day frequency and the blood sugar monitoring routine are both omitted]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0038", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "The child has a high temperature, a sore throat, and swollen glands.", "chosen": "У ребёнка высокая температура, болит горло и увеличены лимфоузлы.", "rejected": "У ребёнка высокая температура.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - sore throat and swollen glands are omitted removing two of three diagnostic symptoms]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0039", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "Apply the cream twice daily and keep the area dry and clean.", "chosen": "Наносите крем дважды в день и держите область чистой и сухой.", "rejected": "Наносите крем дважды в день.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - keep the area dry and clean is omitted removing important wound-care instruction]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0040", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T08", "source_text": "He has lost weight, feels constantly tired, and has excessive thirst.", "chosen": "Он похудел, постоянно чувствует усталость и испытывает сильную жажду.", "rejected": "Он похудел и устал.", "defect_type": "omission", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: omission - excessive thirst is omitted and constantly is dropped weakening the clinical picture of possible diabetes symptoms]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0041", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "The Red Cross clinic is open on Saturdays.", "chosen": "Клиника Красного Креста работает по субботам.", "rejected": "Клиника Красного Пересечения работает в субботы.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - Red Cross must be rendered as Красный Крест not translated literally; по субботам is preferred over в субботы]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0042", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "She was referred to the Botkin Infectious Disease Hospital.", "chosen": "Её направили в Инфекционную клиническую больницу имени Боткина.", "rejected": "Её направили в Боткин госпиталь.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - Боткин госпиталь is a calque and uses the English word hospital; the correct Russian name uses имени Боткина]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0043", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "Professor Ivanov heads the cardiology department.", "chosen": "Профессор Иванов руководит кардиологическим отделением.", "rejected": "Профессор Иванов хедует кардиологический департамент.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - хедует is not a Russian word; руководить is correct and отделение is preferred over департамент in a hospital context]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0044", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "UNICEF supports vaccination programs in rural areas.", "chosen": "ЮНИСЕФ поддерживает программы вакцинации в сельских районах.", "rejected": "Юнисеф поддерживает вакцинационные программы в руральных областях.", "defect_type": "wrong_word_choice", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_word_choice - ЮНИСЕФ is the established Russian abbreviation; руральных is a false loan; сельских районах is standard]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0045", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T09", "source_text": "Dr. Smirnova works at the Sechenov Medical University.", "chosen": "Доктор Смирнова работает в Медицинском университете имени Сеченова.", "rejected": "Доктор Смирнова работает в Sеченов Медицинский Университет.", "defect_type": "grammar_error", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: grammar_error - mixed Cyrillic-Latin spelling and missing prepositional case and имени construction are all errors]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0046", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "You should see a doctor immediately.", "chosen": "Вам следует немедленно обратиться к врачу.", "rejected": "You should see a doctor immediately.", "defect_type": "literal_translation", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: literal_translation - source text is copied verbatim instead of translated]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "corruption_type": "copied_source"}
{"pair_id": "translator-en-ru-general-batch-018-heldout-0047", "stream_id": "translator-en-ru-general", "batch_index": 18, "pair_family": "T01", "source_text": "He has a knee injury.", "chosen": "У него травма колена.", "rejected": "Колено — это сустав, соединяющий бедро и голень. В данном случае оно травмировано.", "defect_type": "wrong_register", "defect_annotation": "[WRONG: wrong_register - encyclopedic anatomy description replaces the direct translation of the clinical statement]", "source_id": "TR-S01", "source_license_state": "ACCEPT", "direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "topic_label": "health_body", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general", "split": "heldout", "routing_labels": {"direction": "EN_RU", "topic_domain": "general", "register": "neutral", "risk_class": "normal", "translation_level": 1, "adapter_id": "adapter-en-ru-general"}, "corruption_type": "explanation_instead_of_translation"}
